WEBVTT

cue0072722
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The prophets that were championing the cause of idols of the Baʿal, of foreign gods, the Baʿal and the Asherah, under the auspices of the king, he challenges them.

cue0072723
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:29.000
They come to Har Karmel, to Mount Karmel in Haifa, and they offer a sacrifice, and the fire is supposed to come from God.

cue0072724
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.040
They pray, they pray, all kind of exotic rituals.

cue0072725
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.020
They cut themselves, they pierce themselves.

cue0072726
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.000
They pray in vain.

cue0072727
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.260
No fire comes.

cue0072728
00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.940
Finally, Yahweh offers the sacrifice to God.

cue0072729
00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:55.280
And He prays, fire comes from heaven and fulminates the sacrifice.

cue0072730
00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.860
the people see it

cue0072731
00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.980
and they fall on their face

cue0072732
