ʾAdonai Huwa ʾElohim

cue0072734
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.100
ʾAdonai Huwa ʾElohim

cue0072735
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.440
a dramatic act

cue0072736
00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.940
there had been drought

cue0072737
00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:08.780
in Israel for three years

cue0072738
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.340
because the people were worshipping idols

cue0072739
