they slaughtered them by a stream.

cue0072746
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.760
Yes, Nahal Kishon.

cue0072747
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.520
And there's a reason why they slaughtered them by the Nahal Kishon.

cue0072748
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.220
For them, the blood of these people,

cue0072749
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.000
