cue0072750
00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:39.760
These people were very evil.

cue0072751
00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:45.800
The Jewish people didn't want their blood to soil the earth.

cue0072752
00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.160
And so they slaughtered by the river,

cue0072753
00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.920
so the river would take their blood away.

cue0072754
00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:55.920
You know, in that sense, their blood will not...

